{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/07/24/4324656/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわあああああああ、Mステ\n出演してきました(ˊ•̤ω•̤ˋ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたーん見て頂けましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、今日は特別にMVの衣装での\n出演ということだったので\n髪型もMVのまんまのお団子♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんの小さい頃の写真は\n衝撃的だったけど、\nとってもおにぎりが似合う可愛らしい子\nでしたね〜放送見てくれた方は分かるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見れてないよーって方はきっと\nググッたら絶対出てくるはず....笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空き時間があったので飛鳥と\nじゃれて遊んでたら面白い写真が\nとれたの〜(ˊ•̤ω•̤ˋ)ぶれぶれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/07/24/4324656/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、こんな写真も珍しいかな〜って\n思ったりしたから載せてみるの。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後は、ななとセブンに売ってる\n中本の蒙古タンメンの\n北極買って食べてみたり...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/07/24/4324656/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、辛いけど病み付きになる美味しさ♡\nみなみ 真夏 ななみん みさ 若月\nまいまい かずみんにもあげてみたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな まいまい かずみん以外は\n皆「うん！美味しい♡」って\n言ってたんだ〜\n乃木坂、辛いの強いみたいだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はそんな楽しい楽しい一日でした\nちゃんちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も握手会でふぁみたんと\nお喋り出来るし楽しみだな〜\n何話そうかな〜\n辛い食べ物についても楽しそうだな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！でも辛いの苦手な人は\n甘い食べ物のお話でもしようよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2015/07/24/4324656/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・7/24 発売B.L.T 北野とのグラビア\n・7/31 アップデートガールズ おに魂に密着"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のセブンイレブン限定盤ライブ\n盛り上がるぞーーー٩(๑❛ʚ❛๑)۶\nライブ好き好き大好きなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くの方にも届くように動きますね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を見てほしいです♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後になってしまいましたが\nお誕生日コメント\nANNA SUIおめでとうコメント\n沢山の方からの言葉が本当に嬉しくて\n胸がいっぱいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}